# Pairs with AtomicAcrossCutover. The routing tier places a bound prepare on
# whatever copy its cached pair names (#4358), so a prepare lands on a copy the
# saga was never bound to and never discards; the shadow is then served torn
# between a revert's swap and its redirect.
MODULE: AtomicAcrossCutoverRouterIgnoresBinding
TARGET: AtomicAcrossCutover
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a bound prepare is placed on any published copy that admits it
PERTURBS: Prepare

--- FIND
    /\ RoutedAdmits(bound)
    /\ pend' = [pend EXCEPT ![bound][k] = TRUE]
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: the router ignores the binding.
    /\ \E c \in pub : RoutedAdmits(c) /\ pend' = [pend EXCEPT ![c][k] = TRUE]
--- END